n0 at r0 0
t0 at r0 1
big lt 512 n0
n select big 512 n0
z call zeros512
s0 rec z t0
rd fold readbyte n s0
src at rd 0
t1 at rd 1
pr call parse src n
pcode at pr 0
pool at pr 2
sym at pr 3
types at pr 4
tlist at pr 5
fns at pr 6
nodes at pr 7
args at pr 8
